  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added:\n- Documented the destination table name contract: the name is passed to\n  SqlBulkCopy verbatim, so the caller owns quoting and multi-part qualification\n  (for example [schema].[table]).\n\nChanged:\n- WriteDataAsync now fails fast with InvalidOperationException when no property\n  has been mapped, and opens the connection whenever it is not already open\n  (previously only a Closed connection was opened, leaving Broken/Connecting to\n  fail later).\n- Faster per-cell bulk-copy reads: the data reader now uses an array-backed\n  accessor store with a constant-time indexer.\n\nFixed:\n- The data reader now honors the IDataReader contract: GetBytes and GetChars\n  return the field length when given a null buffer, GetOrdinal throws\n  IndexOutOfRangeException for an unknown column name, accessing a field before\n  the first read throws InvalidOperationException, HasRows reports false for an\n  empty source, and GetSchemaTable returns an independent copy whose column\n  names match GetName.",
